之前她被绑架的事，回忆浮现在眼前，一年前，她刚从公司下班，准备回家，却被一群人围堵在地下停车场，由于身子不便，经过打斗，还是被人劫了去，等她醒来的时候，小腹上的疼痛提醒着她发生了什么，她刚刚三个月的孩子就这样被人活生生挖去了，没等她从丧子之痛中缓过来，迎接她的就是心爱的丈夫冷锋为了救她，死于枪下。虽然后来她被人救了，可是，生命中最重要的人都不在了，她只觉得心灰意冷，但答应了爷爷的事情，她一定会做到，不然，她真想陪着冷锋和他们的孩子一起死。等到了医院，处理好伤口，医生又告诉她一个晴天霹雳，不单单是她的孩子，就连她的子宫也一起被人挖走了，从此，她失去了一个做母亲的权利，她再也听不到软糯糯叫妈咪的声音了。揉揉发痛的头，战轻狂从痛苦的回忆中睁开眼，瞟了一眼资料，心中的怒气不断上涨，真没想到，造成一切的是她的亲大哥战轻扬，她当初就怀疑，事情是身边的人做的，毕竟知道她下班路线的，能在地下停车场安排人手的没几个人，而且就算是仇家，为什么不直接杀了她？却用如此极端的手段，杀了她的孩子，她隐隐明白，可是，大哥是她在这世上唯一的亲人了，她真的不想怀疑他，今天，证据确凿，她再也没有理由不为冷锋和孩子报仇了。“嘭”的一声，办公室的大门被踹开，战轻扬带着十来个人闯了进来。“大少爷，你这是什么意思？”管家冷着脸，刚想阻止，就被一枪打在胸前，震惊的看着面前阴险的人，他死不瞑目。“怎么？不装了？”将双脚搭在办公桌上，战轻狂仰着头，好像根本不把这些人放在眼里。战轻扬最受不了的就是她这一副风轻云淡的样子，显得自己就像个跳梁小丑一样，刚想冲动的上前，却又不知想到了什么，含笑走到她面前，和战轻狂的视线对上。“妹妹，我不知道你在说什么。”“哦？怎么，敢做不敢当啊？啧啧…”战轻狂摇摇头，很可惜的说道。战轻扬瞬间破功，他最恨别人看不起他，尤其是眼前的妹妹，“不许你用那样的眼神看我，你把我当成可怜虫吗？”“你知不知道，全天底下我最恨的人就是你，明明我才是战家的嫡长子，子承父业，凭什么族长的位置要交给你，我不甘心，我不甘心，从小爷爷，爸爸妈妈就疼你，你是女孩子，我忍了，可是，你为什么还要跟我抢战家，老老实实的嫁人生子有什么不好？爸爸妈妈离开后，爷爷对你更是疼爱有佳，还将这偌大的战家给了你，那我呢？他又置我于何地？所以，你们不给我，那我就自己抢过来，我还要将你最珍视的东西一样一样的毁掉，你知不知道，冷锋是我亲手打死的，你的肚子是我亲手剖开的，有你一个还不够，我怎么会让你再生下一个和你一样的孽种，对，没错，都是我做的，现在，整个战家都握在我手里，就剩下你一个，你说，我该怎么对你呢？我亲爱的妹妹？”战轻扬神色癫狂的说完，将手中的枪指向了她。明白眼前情势不对，战轻狂将心中的愤怒压下，站起身来，绕过桌子，走到他面前。“想要战家，就凭你？”冷哼一声，战轻狂嗤之以鼻。“不许你瞧不起我，啊~你们给我上，快上…”战轻扬指挥着他带来的手下，自己却退到门口，他这个妹妹的身手，那可是打遍天下无敌手的。一时间，办公室内纸张声，匕首声，枪声，人声响成一片，战轻狂随手拿起桌上的钢笔，插在逼近之人的咽喉上，一下毙命，出手快狠准，闪身躲在办公桌后边，战轻狂撕下裙子的一角，将受伤的胳膊包扎上，匆匆止了血，听着周围的呼吸声，战轻狂很快就分析好所有人的位置，还有五个人，打开抽屉，将小夹子拿在手中，深呼吸一口气，跳起散出，招招对准人的死穴，只听咚咚咚的几声，强壮的汉子都应声而倒，所有喧嚣的声音都停止了，只剩下战轻狂剧烈的喘息声，还有战轻扬紧张的牙齿不断打颤的声音。“你…你不要…过来，别过来…”举起手中的枪，双腿不断发抖。一步步走向门口，战轻狂思绪复杂，有怀念，愤怒，憎恨，还有释然，究竟是为什么会发展到今天这个地步，她不禁想起，爷爷病危时对她说的话。“轻狂啊，爷爷把战家交给你了，你要好好守护它。”“可是，不是还有大哥呢吗？”“你大哥不行，轻扬他勇而激发，后劲不足，做不到善始善终，若是家业小点，交给他守成也好，可是这偌大的战家，爷爷不放心啊，你就不一样了，从小你就聪明，有勇有谋，能够纵观大局，战家的掌舵人非你莫属，只有你才能将战家发扬光大，若你是男孩，那该多好，多好…”“爷爷…爷爷…”“你答应爷爷，好好的守护战家，咳咳…答应我！”“我答应，我答应…”握紧爷爷的手，战轻狂点头答应，看着爷爷欣慰的笑了，她知道，肩上的胆子有多重。突然，脚一软，战轻狂跪倒在地。“哈哈哈，你输了，你输了…终于有一天，你栽倒我手上了…”战轻扬仰天大笑。五脏六腑传来的疼痛，以及嘴角流出来的血，战轻狂擦了一下，不由得苦笑。是那档案袋里的资料吧！原来为了对付她，还真是无所不用其极啊！“战轻狂，你痛苦吧！难受吧！那你知不知道这些年我每天过的都是这样的日子？不过，一切都结束了，只要你消失了，所有的一切就都是我的了，明天，各个媒体都会报道，战家当家人被仇家所害，死于大火之中，没有人会怀疑我，到时候我则成为名正言顺的继承人，所以，别怨我，你去死吧！”收了枪，战轻扬将门口准备好的汽油都倒在周围，狞笑的看着倒在地上动弹不得的妹妹，拿起打火机，扔进屋里。“无知的傻子，呵呵…”头发遮住了脸旁，纵火的人没看到隐藏的冷笑。“嗖”的一下，战轻狂将手中的钢笔当做暗器，飞射进他的脊椎骨，只听咔嚓一声，战轻扬惊愕的转回身，不甘的看着张狂的女子。“第一，战家家训，永远不要将后边对着敌人；第二，你明知我的手段，还是小看了我；第三嘛…是你蠢啊！”听到这话，战轻扬不甘的闭上眼，含恨而终。是啊，他怎么能小看这人呢？悔不当初啊！终于报仇了，战轻狂觉得她对得起死去的冷锋和孩子了，只是爷爷的嘱托，战家该怎么办？拿起电话，拨了一个号，她得为战家找个人接替她的位置。“喂…我说狂姐姐，这么闲，有时间给我打电话啊？”电话里的声音显得那样玩世不恭。“战轻风，有好事找你，咳咳…”“有好事，你能想到我？我才不信。”“战轻风，咳咳…我把…战家，交给你了，从今天起，你…你就是战家当家…人了…”听到情况不对，战轻风收了开玩笑的心，“喂，你怎么了，发生什么事了？”“战轻风，别让我失望。”“喂，喂，到底怎么了？你一副交代遗嘱的样子，你别吓我，你现在在哪？”电话里一阵噼里啪啦的声音，接着传来大力的摔门声。挂断电话，周围的火光烧得她咳嗽不止，勉强走到保险箱前，将手中的扳指放进去。做完这一切，战轻狂就那样靠在墙角，看着头顶的吊灯。心愿已了，她也觉得累了，战轻风是三叔的儿子，虽然顽劣，可是能力和手段不亚于自己，战家交给他，也算对得起爷爷了。“嘭”的一声，整个楼层都发生了大爆炸，黑烟滚滚，路人纷纷躲避逃跑。等到战轻风赶到的时候，场面混乱的可以，看着发生爆炸的楼层，他震惊的瞪大双眼，那是，那是战轻狂所在的楼层，怎么会？消防员，交警，巡警，警察，路人的哭声喊声，嘈杂一片，他觉得他是在做梦。直到有人将保险柜交到他手里，他才相信这是真的，刚才的电话也是真的。“风少爷，现场除了十几具尸体，就只剩下这个保险箱了。”战轻风接过，身体震了一下，他在她的办公室里看见过，是x国的新型金属打造的，全世界就那么三个。回到车里，尝试了几次，终于打开了，一厚摞的机密文件好好地放着，上边放着的是战家传家的扳指，除非新一代家主更替，不得摘下。望向车外，看着一具具焦黑的尸体抬出，他红了眼眶，那样风华绝代，聪颖霸气的战轻狂就这样没了？死的这般惨烈？－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－推荐好友的文文：《村头狮吼，农家童养夫》【第八个字母】腹黑萌宝是相公《兽宠天下，毒妃妖娆》【幻鹫冰灵】强者为王，败者暖床，佣兵穿越开启巅峰之路《生财有道：欢脱世子妃》【老虎不吃鱼】宠文，腹黑病夫欢脱刁蛮妃。《巨星崛起：修真狂后》【影氏公子】鬼才修真女穿成言情小说女配，绝色逆袭，王牌天后！《总裁专宠：妈咪不守妇道》【卿本素颜】天才萌宝，腹黑妈咪", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 1 Human Greed Sitting in a huge and simple office, Zhan Qingkuang kept flipping through the reports in his hands, thinking while reading them. \"Dong dong\" \"Come in.\" Zhan Qingkuang frowned without raising his head. \"Miss, you asked me to find out something about the matter.\" A middle-aged man in his forties, wearing a decent black suit and meticulously combed hair, respectfully and fearfully handed the file bag in his hand to the table. Looking carefully, it is not difficult to find that there is a flash of kindness deep in the middle-aged man's eyes. \"Oh?\" Zhan Qingkuang raised his eyebrows as he stopped what he was doing, took the file bag in his hand, and leaned on the chair. Looking through the information in his hand, Zhan Qingkuang's face became increasingly ugly. Finally, he sighed deeply, threw the information on the table, and closed his eyes in pain. She asked the housekeeper to find out that she was kidnapped a year ago, and the memories came to her mind. A year ago, she had just got off work from the company and was about to go home, but she was surrounded by a group of people in the underground parking lot. Due to her physical disability, she was robbed after a fight. Waiting for her When she woke up, the pain in her lower abdomen reminded her of what had happened. Her three-month-old child had been poached alive. Before she could recover from the pain of losing her child, what greeted her was that her beloved husband, Leng Feng, died from a gun in order to save her. Although she was rescued later, the most important person in her life was gone. She only felt disheartened, but she would definitely do what she promised her grandfather. Otherwise, she really wanted to die with Leng Feng and their child. After arriving at the hospital and treating the wound, the doctor told her that not only her child, but also her uterus had been taken away. From then on, she lost the right to be a mother, and she could no longer hear the soft voice calling mommy. Rubbing her aching head, Zhan Qingkuang opened her eyes from the painful memories and glanced at the information. The anger in her heart continued to rise. She really didn't expect that it was her elder brother Zhan Qingyang who caused everything. She had suspected at the beginning that the things were done by people around her. After all, there were few people who knew her route to get off work and could arrange manpower in the underground parking lot. And even if she was an enemy, why not just kill her? But she used such extreme means to kill her child, she vaguely understood, but her eldest brother was her only relative in the world, and she really didn't want to doubt him. Today, the evidence was conclusive, and she no longer had any reason not to avenge Leng Feng and her child. With a \"bang\", the door to the office was kicked open, and Zhan Qingyang broke in with about ten people. \"Young Master, what do you mean?\" The butler had a cold face. Just as he was about to stop him, he was shot in the chest. He looked at the insidious man in front of him in shock and refused to close his eyes. \"What? No more pretending?\" Putting his feet on the desk, Zhan Qingkuang raised his head, as if he didn't care about these people at all. What Zhan Qingyang couldn't stand the most was her indifferent appearance, which made her look like a clown. He was about to impulsively step forward, but he didn't know what he thought of. He walked up to her with a smile and met Zhan Qingmang's eyes. \"Sister, I don't know what you are talking about.\" \"Oh? What, do you dare to do it or not? Tsk...\" Zhan Qingkuang shook his head and said with regret. Zhan Qingyang succeeded in an instant. He hated others looking down on him, especially the sister in front of him. \"You are not allowed to look at me like that. Do you think I am a pitiful person?\" \"Do you know that the person I hate the most in the world is you. I am obviously the eldest son of the Zhan family, and I inherit my father's inheritance. Why do I have a clan?\" I am not willing to give the position of elder to you, I am not willing to do so. Grandpa and Mom and Dad have loved you since you were a child. You are a girl, so I can't bear it. But why do you want to fight for the family with me? What's wrong with getting married and having children honestly? After Mom and Dad left, Grandpa loves you even more and will continue to do so. This huge Zhan family is given to you, what about me? So, if you don't give it to me, then I will take it away myself, and I will destroy everything you cherish most. Do you know that I killed Leng Feng with my own hands, and I cut your belly open with my own hands, and you are the one who can't do it? \"Enough, how could I let you regenerate a scoundrel like you? Yes, that's right, I did it. Now, the entire Zhan family is in my hands, and you are the only one left. What should I do to you? My dear sister?\" Zhan Qingyang said with a crazy look, pointing the gun in his hand at her. Realizing that something was wrong with the situation at hand, Zhan Qingkuang suppressed the anger in his heart, stood up, walked around the table, and walked to him. \"If you want the Zhan family, it's up to you?\" Zhan Qingkuang snorted coldly. \"You are not allowed to look down on me, ah~ Come on here, come on quickly...\" Zhan Qingyang commanded the men he brought with him, but he retreated to the door. The skills of his younger sister were unrivaled in the world. For a moment, the office was filled with the sound of paper, daggers, gunfire, and human voices. Zhan Qingkuang picked up the pen on the table and inserted it into the throat of the approaching person. Killing him with one strike, he shot quickly and accurately. He hid behind the desk. Zhan Qingkuang tore off a corner of his skirt, bandaged his injured arm, and hurriedly stopped the bleeding. Listening to the breathing around him, Zhan Qingkuang soon died. After analyzing the positions of everyone, there were five people, opened the drawer, took the small clip in his hand, took a deep breath, jumped up and spread out, aiming his moves at the person's weak point. Only a few \"dong-dong-dong\" sounds were heard, the strong man fell down, all the noisy sounds stopped, only Zhan Qingkuang's violent breathing, and the sound of Zhan Qingyang's nervous teeth chattering continuously. \"You...you don't...come here, don't come here...\" He raised the gun in his hand and his legs kept shaking. Walking towards the door step by step, Zhan Qingkuang had complicated thoughts, including nostalgia, anger, hatred, and relief. Why did it develop to this point? She couldn't help but think of what her grandfather said to her when he was critically ill.", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}